OL,3,GNEWSA'Rock and hard place' concern as
OL,4,Ahomes approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer has been given the go ahead
OL,7,Fto build 58 homes in a village - but
OL,8,Fonly after some councillors complained
OL,9,Fthey had no other choice.
OL,11,FWiltshire Council's planning committee
OL,12,Fapproved outline permission for the
OL,13,Fhomes on farmland at Berryfield, near
OL,14,FMelksham.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
