OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1788764146
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Rock and hard place' concern as
OL,4,Ahomes approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee heard there had been 160
OL,7,Fobjections to the proposal - although
OL,8,Fmany were about potentially building
OL,9,Fover the route of a nearby canal. Plans
OL,10,Fhad been reduced from 68 to 58 homes
OL,11,Fafter talks between applicant Martin
OL,12,FGrant Homes, drainage specialists and
OL,13,Fthe Wilts & Berks Canal Trust.
OL,15,FCouncillor Charlie Stokes said the
OL,16,Fcommittee was "stuck between a rock and
OL,17,Fa hard place" as it would struggle to
OL,18,Fwin an appeal if it refused.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
